title: "iot-nids-realisability-gap: a reproducible digital-twin benchmark for the realisability gap of flow-based IoT intrusion detectors"
abstract: "Analysis code for measuring how much feature-space adversarial evasion of flow-based IoT intrusion detectors a host-only attacker can realise as executed, functionality-checked traffic, in a reproducible Containernet/Open vSwitch digital twin with MQTT, CoAP and HTTP services."
